# HVF NEXUS PRECISION ACTUATION & RWS TELEMETRY CORE V1.0
**Classification:** UNCLASSIFIED / PUBLIC ARCHITECTURAL & PROCUREMENT MANIFEST  
**Author:** Jeffery Humphrey, CEO & Lead Embedded Engineer  
